    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp1_1",
      "text": "昨天我去商店买帽子。",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 2960,
      "durationMs": 2960,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p1_hcp1_1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp1_2",
      "text": "商店里的帽子很多。",
      "startMs": 2960,
      "endMs": 4960,
      "durationMs": 2000,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p1_hcp1_2.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp1_3",
      "text": "我看见红色的、黑色的和白色的。",
      "startMs": 4960,
      "endMs": 10000,
      "durationMs": 5040,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p1_hcp1_3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp1_4",
      "text": "红色的很好看，但是有点贵。",
      "startMs": 10000,
      "endMs": 13520,
      "durationMs": 3520,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p1_hcp1_4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp1_5",
      "text": "黑色的很便宜，但是我不喜欢。",
      "startMs": 13520,
      "endMs": 18080,
      "durationMs": 4560,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p1_hcp1_5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp1_6",
      "text": "白色的也可以，但是太小了。",
      "startMs": 18080,
      "endMs": 21720,
      "durationMs": 3640,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p1_hcp1_6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp1_7",
      "text": "我不知道买哪一个。",
      "startMs": 21720,
      "endMs": 24480,
      "durationMs": 2760,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p1_hcp1_7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp1_8",
      "text": "这时候，我的朋友来了。",
      "startMs": 24480,
      "endMs": 27480,
      "durationMs": 3000,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p1_hcp1_8.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp1_9",
      "text": "他问我：“你喜欢什么颜色的？”",
      "startMs": 27480,
      "endMs": 31840,
      "durationMs": 4360,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p1_hcp1_9.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp1_10",
      "text": "我说：“我喜欢红色，但是太贵了。”",
      "startMs": 31840,
      "endMs": 36400,
      "durationMs": 4560,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p1_hcp1_10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "hcp1_11",
      "text": "他说：“那边还有蓝色的，你去看看。”",
      "startMs": 36400,
      "endMs": 40560,
      "durationMs": 4160,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_chapeau_p1_hcp1_11.mp3"
    }
